# BMAD: personal overrides and generated TEA/render output.
# Story specs under _bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/ are tracked so
# GitHub/ChatGPT review can see the working specs, not only snapshot copies.
_bmad/config.user.toml
_bmad/custom/config.user.toml
_bmad-output/test-artifacts/

# BMAD skill launchers that duplicate .agents/skills (Grok/Codex/Cursor/Hermes/Kilo
# share that directory). Claude Code uses .claude/skills; Antigravity uses .agent/skills;
# Copilot uses .github/agents. Re-run `npx bmad-method install` to regenerate others.
